      <p>电脑和手机都能先养一只。想说话了，打开设置里的「搭子」，换一对码，派一张 GIF 过去。</p>
      <div class="download-version-line">
        <span data-release-version="windows/x64">Windows 最新版</span>
        <span data-release-version="macos/arm64">macOS 最新版</span>
        <span data-release-version="android/arm64-v8a">Android 最新版</span>
